## 7. Example session usage

Type this in a chat message (your own text, not generated by Claude):

  GATEGUARD-BATCH-AUTH: glob=docs/minecraft-lore/mobs/* ops=Write,Edit ext=.md max=30 ttl=3600 risk=plain-markdown-lore-docs

After that message, any Write or Edit to a .md file under docs/minecraft-lore/mobs/
passes through without the gate loop, up to 30 files.
The authorization is scoped to this session's transcript and does not carry
forward to future sessions unless you issue the directive again.
